          <li>Use the Application in violation of any applicable law or regulation, or in any manner that interferes with or disrupts the integrity or performance of the Application, the Intuit platform, or any third-party service.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Intuit QuickBooks Integration</h2>
        <p>The Application connects to Intuit QuickBooks through application programming interfaces made available by Intuit Inc. ("Intuit"). By connecting the Application to your QuickBooks account, you authorize IData and the Application to access, retrieve, transmit, and process data from your QuickBooks account as necessary to provide the Application's functionality.</p>
        <p>You acknowledge and agree that:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your use of QuickBooks and other Intuit products is governed by your separate agreement with Intuit, and you are responsible for maintaining a valid QuickBooks subscription and complying with Intuit's terms of service;</li>
          <li>Intuit is not a party to this Agreement, does not endorse the Application, and makes no warranties of any kind, express or implied, with respect to the Application;</li>
