        <p>You are responsible for the accuracy and legality of Your Data and for having all rights and consents necessary to provide it. Our collection and handling of personal information is described in our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>, which is incorporated into this Agreement by reference.</p>

        <h2>5. Accounts and Security</h2>
        <p>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of any credentials used to access the Application or to authorize its connection to your QuickBooks account, and for all activities that occur under your account. You agree to notify IData promptly of any unauthorized access or use.</p>

