        <h2>7. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>The Application may interoperate with third-party products and services, including those provided by Intuit. IData does not control and is not responsible for third-party products or services, and your use of them is at your own risk and subject to the applicable third party's terms.</p>

        <h2>8. Updates and Changes</h2>
        <p>IData may from time to time update, modify, or discontinue the Application or any of its features, with or without notice. This Agreement applies to all updates and upgrades that IData makes available, unless such updates are accompanied by separate terms.</p>

        <h2>9. Term and Termination</h2>
        <p>This Agreement is effective from the date you first use the Application and continues until terminated. You may terminate this Agreement at any time by discontinuing use of the Application and disconnecting it from your QuickBooks account. IData may suspend or terminate your access to the Application at any time if you breach this Agreement or if IData discontinues the Application. Upon termination, the license granted to you will immediately end and you must cease all use of the Application. Sections 2, 4, 6, 10, 11, 12, and 13 survive termination.</p>

        <h2>10. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>THE APPLICATION IS PROVIDED "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE," WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, IDATA AND ITS LICENSORS DISCLAIM ALL WARRANTIES, EXPRESS, IMPLIED, OR STATUTORY, INCLUDING WITHOUT LIMITATION ANY WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, TITLE, AND NON-INFRINGEMENT, AND ANY WARRANTIES ARISING FROM COURSE OF DEALING OR USAGE OF TRADE. IDATA DOES NOT WARRANT THAT THE APPLICATION WILL BE UNINTERRUPTED, ERROR-FREE, OR SECURE, OR THAT DATA OBTAINED THROUGH THE APPLICATION, INCLUDING DATA RETRIEVED FROM QUICKBOOKS, WILL BE ACCURATE OR COMPLETE. THE APPLICATION DOES NOT PROVIDE ACCOUNTING, TAX, LEGAL, OR FINANCIAL ADVICE, AND YOU ARE SOLELY RESPONSIBLE FOR DECISIONS MADE BASED ON INFORMATION PROVIDED THROUGH THE APPLICATION.</p>

